  Canadian Council of the Blind\, Toronto Visionaries Chapter. The book clu
 b is open to those who are living with vision loss or have low vision or a
 re deaf-blind\, and to their sighted support workers. The book club meets 
 on third Wednesday of very month. August's book is\nThe Heaven and Earth G
 rocery Store\nby James McBride.
