BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adult Afternoon Movie - Jane Austen Wrecked My Life (2024)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260901T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260901T160000
UID:6a346614dcc1022f003a11c2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:An aspiring author (Camille Rutherford) takes up a writing res
 idency and finds herself in the sort of romantic entanglements that could 
 only come from the pages of a Jane Austen novel.\nR\, 98 minutes\nLanguage
  spoken: English and French\n**Subtitles for the Deaf and Hard of Hearing 
 (SDH) when available.
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program Room 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a346614dcc1022f003a11c2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adult Afternoon Movie - The Roses (2025)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T160000
UID:6a3465fb3e640a440019fbc6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Life seems easy for picture-perfect couple Ivy (Olivia Colman)
  and Theo (Benedict Cumberbatch): successful careers\, great kids\, and a 
 loving marriage. But underneath the façade of the perfect family is a tin
 derbox of competition and resentments that's ignited when Theo's professio
 nal dreams come crashing down.\nR\, 105 minutes\n**Subtitles for the deaf 
 and hard of hearing when available (SDH).
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program Room 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3465fb3e640a440019fbc6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
