DESCRIPTION:Have questions about your tablet\, phone\, laptop\, email or a
 n app? Need help with eBooks or other online library services? Our staff a
 re here to teach you technology tools and concepts in a friendly and casua
 l setting. Please bring your personal device and any questions you may hav
 e.\nDrop-in\, no registration required.\n20 minute limit during high deman
