BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wednesday Afternoon @ the Movies: Not Without Hope
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260729T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260729T150000
UID:6a1b2a48c7d3cd58005ce3b3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Wednesday afternoon at the library for a screening 
 of Not Without Hope movie.\nBased on a true story\, friends Nick\, Will\,
  Marquis\, and Corey's boat capsizes in the Gulf of Mexico. Battling storm
 s\, sharks\, and hypothermia\, they fight to survive as the Coast Guard mo
 unts a daring rescue to bring them home.\nRated 14A. 2hr.\nEnglish Subtitl
 es for the Deaf and Hard of Hearing (SDH) when available.
LOCATION:Weston\, Program Room. Lower Level.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a1b2a48c7d3cd58005ce3b3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
