DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260811T150000
UID:69fb78c2177319280017d946@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun afternoon of solving brain puzzles such as W
 ordle\, Spelling Bee\, Connections\, Wheel of Fortune\, and many more!\nMa
 ke new friends\, stimulate your mind\, improve your memory\, and relieve y
 our stress.\nDrop-in.
