BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seniors' Social: Everyday Art: An Evaluation of Our Visual Literac
 y Workshop.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T150000
UID:6a5157a5aa34e23600ee4465@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Grow your understanding and appreciation of art. This program 
 aims to analyze and breakdown primary visual elements to open the eyes of 
 non-artist individuals to visual arts. Participants learn about the attrib
 utes of primary visual elements\, like dot\, line\, shape\, and color. Vis
 ual Relations between those visual elements and Material Properties are ot
 her subjects of discussion.
LOCATION:St. Clair/Silverthorn\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5157a5aa34e23600ee4465
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
