BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bone Health 101: Strong Bones for Life骨骼健康101：強健骨
 骼，健康生活
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260904T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260904T150000
UID:6a4d818f57d78b36002b7137@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that 1 in 3 women and 1 in 5 men will experience 
 an osteoporosis-related fracture in their lifetime? Join a trained volunte
 er from Osteoporosis Canada to learn how to keep your bones healthy\, redu
 ce your risk of fractures\, and prevent falls through healthy lifestyle ch
 oices.\nProgram presented in\nEnglish and Chinese\n.\n您知道嗎？每\n
 3\n位女性和每\n5\n位男性中，就有\n1\n人可能在一生中發
 生骨質疏鬆相關骨折。歡迎參加由加拿大骨質疏鬆症協
 會義工帶來的講座，了解如何保持骨骼健康、預防骨折
 及跌倒，並學習健康生活方式的重要知識。
LOCATION:Steeles
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a4d818f57d78b36002b7137
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
