BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Protect Yourself and Your Home: Fire Safety Tips For Seniors 长
 者家居安全与防火知识
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260828T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260828T150000
UID:6a4d74c5704b2c3d00a37b45@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Fire Safety for Seniors\nJoin Toronto Fire Services for a pres
 entation on fire safety and emergency preparedness. Learn how to prevent h
 ome fires\, recognize common fire hazards\, create an emergency escape pla
 n\, know when and how to call for help\, and stay safe in apartments and h
 igh-rise buildings. The program will be presented in English/Mandarin.\n
 长者消防安全讲座\n欢迎参加由多伦多消防局举办的消防
 安全讲座。了解如何预防家居火灾、识别常见火灾隐患
 、制定紧急逃生计划、正确拨打求助电话，以及在公寓
 和高层住宅中保持安全。讲座将以英语/普通话进行。
LOCATION:Steeles
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a4d74c5704b2c3d00a37b45
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
