BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Innovation Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T200000
UID:69aeef0ab0595799c0a1e605@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Conversation is the source of innovation!\nJoin TPL Innovation
  Council member\nZahra Ebrahim\nfor a series of lively book discussions ab
 out how we can build a better world by getting better at talking with eac
 h other.\nOur September book is TBD - register for updates!\nInformation C
 ollection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by t
 he Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\
 , 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and progr
 am registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library
  handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerli
 ne@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Junction Triangle\, Program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69aeef0ab0595799c0a1e605
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
