 k.\nSept:\nVioleta\nby Isabel Allende\nOct:\nA Town Called Solace\nby Mary
  Lawson\nNov:\nA Gentleman in Moscow\nby Amor Towles\nDec:\nCreation Lake\
 nby Rachel Cushner\nPlease place a copy of the book on hold\, limited quan
 tities may be made available.\nPLEASE NOTE: The Monday afternoon session i
 s full. Space is still available Wednesday afternoon and Friday evening.
LOCATION:Richview\, Room B\, upstairs
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a31961116554cd59fc932ab
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
