 xplore different genres (fiction and non-fiction). We meet once a month o
 n Saturdays to discuss a new book selected by the library. If you're look
 ing for good reads and stimulating discussion\, this is the group for you!
 \nJune's book is\nHappy-Go-Lucky\nby David Sedaris. Copies are available 
 at Cedarbrae's 1st Floor front desk.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe 
 personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Libra
 ry under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). Th
