DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260713T190000
UID:6a356b73414ef43d00976d8a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Rescheduled event: Toronto Fire Services will be conducting a
  presentation on fire safety for seniors. Topics will include fire prevent
 ion\, causes of home fires\, smoke & carbon monoxide alarms\, escape plann
 ing for special needs\, fire safety in high-rise buildings\, etc. Q&A wil
 l follow.\nDrop in program.
