 the April 16th meeting is:\nLessons for Living\nThe title for the May 21st
  meeting is:\nThe Let Them Theory\nThe title for the June 18th meeting is:
 \nThe Next Conversation\nThe title for the July 16 meeting is:\nYou're Not
  Listening\nThe title for the August 20th meeting is:\nBig Feelings\nThe t
 itle for the September 17th meeting is:\nLighter\nThe title for the Octobe
