BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Word Basics 2: Format a Flyer
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260821T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260821T153000
UID:6a50fd51c7e02e3d00681fd6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Build on your basic Microsoft Word skills and learn to use Wor
 d more effectively.\nIn this class\, you will:\nPractice new Word skills w
 hile you design a flyer\nFormat text\, margins\, indents\, headers and foo
 ters\nFormat text as columns\nCreate bulleted\, numbered and sorted lists\
 nReview your document with Spelling and Grammar check and Thesaurus\nUpon 
 completion of this class\, you will be able to use even more Word tools to
  design your documents.\nPrerequisites:  Word Basics 1 or equivalent skill
 s. Basic keyboarding and mouse skills required.\nFormat: Hands-on with dem
 onstrations\nRegistration is required via tpl.ca or by calling 416-396-894
 3.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Leaning Centre (LC)\, 1st floor.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a50fd51c7e02e3d00681fd6
