BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NEW DATE: Runnymede Film Club Presents: Saturday Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260825T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260825T200000
UID:69fd15ecc7d3cd580057bf67@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a monthly film screening of\nSaturday Night\n(2024
 \, Rated R).\nAt 11:30 pm on October 11\, 1975\, a ferocious troupe of you
 ng comedians and writers changed television\, and culture\, forever. This 
 film is based on the true story of what happened behind the scenes in the 
 90 minutes leading up to the first broadcast of Saturday Night Live.\nDrop
 -in.\n*Please note\, this program will now take place on Tuesday\, August 
 25th from 6-8 pm.
LOCATION:Runnymede\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fd15ecc7d3cd580057bf67
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
