DESCRIPTION:Join our monthly gathering to meet other readers and discuss
  the monthly book!\nThis month we are reading\nA Man Called Ove\n\,\nthe d
 ebut novel by Swedish novelist Fredrik Backman. A curmudgeon hides a t
 errible personal loss beneath a cranky and short-tempered exterior while c
 lashing with new neighbors\, a boisterous family whose chattiness and habi
 ts lead to unexpected friendship.\nCopies of the book are now available f
 or borrowing at the Front Desk. No registration necessary. New members we
 lcome!
LOCATION:Danforth/Coxwell\, Program Room\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a469b2420e0648601958511
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
