DESCRIPTION:Our book selection for July is\nA Room With a View\nby E.M. Fo
 rster. Forster's most optimistic and romantic novel is set in motion by a 
 chance encounter in Italy that offers a young Englishwoman\, Lucy Honeychu
 rch\, a means to escape the stultifying restrictions of her life. While v
 isiting Italy\, she falls in love with the unconventional George Emerson\,
  much to the displeasure of her chaperone and her guardians back in Englan
 d. In the end\, Lucy must decide her own fate.\nCopies available at the li
 brary.\nA Room With A View
