DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260728T194500
UID:6a36dd53dcc1022f003a3cb6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Please join us on Tuesday\, July 28\, at 6:30 p.m. to talk abo
 ut our book of the month\,\nCrow Lake\n.\nSet in northern Ontario\, this c
 oming-of-age story follows the Morrison siblings as they struggle to rise 
 above a devastating childhood tragedy. You can get a copy at the first-flo
 or circulation desk while supplies last. If you prefer an eBook or eAudiob
 ook\, ask library staff how to access them. All are welcome!\nDrop-in\, re
 gistration not required.
