DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T150000
UID:6a296981c7d3cd58005f53c8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover the art of paper quilling in this beginner-friendly w
 orkshop and create a stunning handmade card to take home. Participants wil
 l be introduced to fundamental quilling techniques\, including rolling\, s
 haping\, and arranging paper to form intricate designs. All materials and 
 tools are provided\, allowing you to relax and fully enjoy the creative pr
 ocess.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this f
 orm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries 
